    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark forest is ahead of you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It feels familiar, but you hesitate. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only scraps and glimpses remain. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step inside. Make a choice. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember your purpose... or remember what you were trying to forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Were you searching for something, or running from it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Twiwood Forest</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twiwood Tales is a rogue-like RPG with seductive tension, branching paths, and combat system that rewards planning, awareness, timing, and creativity. Whether you're here for the fight, the story, or something more intimate, the forest welcomes you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Dangerous Path</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run offers new routes, risks, and rewards. Some will test your focus. Others, your patience. Every step takes you closer to your goal, but danger awaits at every fork.\u00a0Build yourself for the journey, and make use of your defenses if you want to come out on top.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twiwood Tales builds on classic turn-based JRPG combat, but with a twist: you can actively defend yourself... or choose not to. For some - timing is everything. For others, a strong body and a sturdy shield are more than enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574000/extras/449eddb101c1905511b6ec4fb57cb716.poster.avif?t=1755019271\" width=626 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574000/extras/449eddb101c1905511b6ec4fb57cb716.webm?t=1755019271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574000/extras/449eddb101c1905511b6ec4fb57cb716.mp4?t=1755019271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Not Every weapon is Steel</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spells and steel will keep you alive, but seductive Techniques offer their own kind of power\u00a0 and their own way of dealing with enemies. What you choose to do with your foes is entirely\u00a0 up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574000/extras/9bdcf9251632acd06dde3d3af093f62b.poster.avif?t=1755019271\" width=626 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574000/extras/9bdcf9251632acd06dde3d3af093f62b.webm?t=1755019271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574000/extras/9bdcf9251632acd06dde3d3af093f62b.mp4?t=1755019271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Moments that Linger</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some encounter leave more than scars. Lingering flashes of animated memories, once lost,\u00a0 may find their way into your hands. Perhaps they'll help you remember. Or offer a bright moment on a long, dark path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574000/extras/e5d1995fd89db2e47cfcbc3643ac9633.poster.avif?t=1755019271\" width=626 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574000/extras/e5d1995fd89db2e47cfcbc3643ac9633.webm?t=1755019271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574000/extras/e5d1995fd89db2e47cfcbc3643ac9633.mp4?t=1755019271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic turn-based combat with timed dodges, parries and seductive Techniques, powerful abilities that offer more than just damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue-like progression with randomized maps and branching paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build variety with dozens of unique items, erotic techniques, and magical spells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic enemy encounters with unique attack patterns and weaknesses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14+ fully animated, interactive adult scenes; unlock and relieve them at your own pace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60+ handcrafted sex poses with free control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hot events, puzzles, and risky choices. It's not always about the fight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full voice acting planned for 1.0 release</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark, seductive story that twists, teases and lingers to the very end</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NO AI! Original art, writing, and gameplay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enter Twiwood</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twiwood Tales is not a quick tease, it's a handcrafted debut with an original, non-cliche story, uniquely arousingly scenes, and bold combat system. Enter the Twiwood Forest, follow your desires, and shape your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574000/extras/c2d7f96b555eccefb171c27ce7dbaba9.poster.avif?t=1755019271\" width=626 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574000/extras/c2d7f96b555eccefb171c27ce7dbaba9.webm?t=1755019271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574000/extras/c2d7f96b555eccefb171c27ce7dbaba9.mp4?t=1755019271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
